tooltip_text = "Controls the noise level required to interrupt a lost-player search and start investigating the noise. Higher values require louder noise to trigger an investigation.

Lower dB → quieter → harder to detect
Higher dB → louder → easier to detect

 -80 dB   -20 dB   -10 dB          0 dB          +10 dB    +20 dB    +80 dB
 Quieter ──────────────── Reference ────────────────→ Louder"
